SUMMARY:Jason: Scandia\, MN
DESCRIPTION:Spiritual retreat at Bethany Center for Prayer & Renewal\n\nSta
 tus: Booked\nBethany Center for Prayer & Renewal\, 23393 Nolan Ave N\, Scan
 dia\, MN 55073. Website: https://bethanyretreats.org/.\nTypical arrival is
  between 6:00-7:00 PM Sunday. Orientation is at 7:15 PM Sunday\, then silen
 ce begins.\nSilence breaks Friday evening with dinner and sharing of graces
  with the other retreat guests.\nTechnically free to leave after dinner aro
 und 7:00 PM Friday\, but most stay the night and leave first thing Saturday
 . Nothing is scheduled Saturday morning.\nAmerican Airlines confirmation is
  on file with Clive\; do not publish booking/payment details publicly.\nBoo
 ked outbound Sun Aug 2: AA6232 FWA-ORD 11:10 AM ET-11:31 AM CT\, then AA400
 0 ORD-MSP 1:45 PM-3:30 PM CT.\nBooked return Sat Aug 8: AA3507 MSP-ORD 10:3
 5 AM-12:18 PM CT\, then AA6295 ORD-FWA 3:55 PM CT-6:08 PM ET.\n\nView live:
  https://jstravelschedule.netlify.app
LOCATION:Scandia\, MN
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
